      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 151,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 351,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "INTENT\nSearch job boards once.\nHarvest companies often.\nPoll selected ATS boards.\nReuse fetched job details.\n\nCURRENT\nATS feeds bypass queue;\nHTML details use it.\nATS ingest still repeats\nscoring and email calls.\n\nTracking starts board\ndiscovery & polling.\n\nBright Data Web Unlocker\nshown explicitly below.",
      "originalText": "INTENT\nSearch job boards once.\nHarvest companies often.\nPoll selected ATS boards.\nReuse fetched job details.\n\nCURRENT\nATS feeds bypass queue;\nHTML details use it.\nATS ingest still repeats\nscoring and email calls.\n\nTracking starts board\ndiscovery & polling.\n\nBright Data Web Unlocker\nshown explicitly below.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 399.0
    },
